{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791394566684,"sessionID":"ses_ee89228fcffeNbSVRYIVCuZekH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_00_HM82wOhazJ2r1f8zeI848936","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","oldString":"Conclusion unchanged: the repository already contains the fix; the production\nwhite card is a stale deploy, not a code defect in this branch.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups","newString":"Conclusion unchanged: the repository already contains the fix; the production\nwhite card is a stale deploy, not a code defect in this branch.\n\n## Finalization (attempt 5)\n\nRe-confirmed against the current worktree; still no product-code change:\n\n- `git show 22c5a68:src/routes/auth/login/+page.svelte` already contains\n  `bg-c-bg-surface` on the form at the merge base `22c5a68`, so the six auth\n  cards inherited the fix from `main` — it was not introduced by this branch.\n- Independently decoded the brief screenshot (`iili.io/CZZtpwX.png`, 973×989)\n  with a standalone PNG reader (no vision model): 89.9% of pixels are the page\n  `#353d4a`, light pixels are only 6.15% with bbox x 38.4–71.2% / y 34.3–62.5%\n  and colour `#ebeef4` (Nord `--color-white`); the inputs are `#454d5e` (≈ Nord\n  elevated `#434c5e`). The only unthemed surface is the auth card, which already\n  carries `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n- `git show 70f6236` left `border-white/5` and `dark:text-white` in place while\n  swapping `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-*` → `bg-c-bg-surface`. The accepted,\n  reviewed fix therefore does not apply TASK-2's two secondary substitutions;\n  applying them would alter default-light rendering and diverge from the fix the\n  team actually shipped.\n- `TimePicker.svelte` already uses `bg-c-bg-modal` (TASK-3 resolved); no\n  `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-*` pair remains anywhere under `src/`.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Ind