t: production now matches the desired behaviour\n+that local already had.\n+\n ## Verification (TASK-4) limitation\n \n `node_modules` is not installed in this environment, so `npm run check`,\n `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, and `npm run preview` could not be\n","additions":30,"deletions":15},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/notes.md","time":{"start":1791394896603,"end":1791394896622}},"id":"prt_11774cfd5001xM7bo1kkcwb074","sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","messageID":"msg_11774c585001s5wJnmYi5xGcDD"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1791394896691,"sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","part":{"id":"prt_11774db27001XIUfKH0hnlVM0r","reason":"tool-calls","snapshot":"","messageID":"msg_11774c585001s5wJnmYi5xGcDD","sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":110565,"input":167,"output":823,"reasoning":135,"cache":{"write":0,"read":109440}},"cost":0.00092817}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1791394898366,"sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","part":{"id":"prt_11774e1bb0017LdKbpQoYWYIdQ","messageID":"msg_11774db31001PKf1kU9Hgshy8w","sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","snapshot":"","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791394904853,"sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_xoNWgJwy2oEvSbF7cGxc6877","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","content":"## Summary\n\nThe white surface reported in `brief.md` was the auth **card**, not the page\nbody and not a late/failed theme load. The cards used the literal utilities\n`bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. The `dark:` variant only fires when `<html>` has\nthe `dark` class, and `ThemeState.apply()` (`src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`)\nexplicitly removes that class for every single-mode theme\n(`supportsDarkMode: false`: nord, skyrim, catppuccin-mocha/-latte, gruvbox,\ndracula, terminal, paper, atari). Under Nord the themed `dark:bg-s-dark-2`\nfallback therefore never applied and the card stayed at Nord's deliberately\nnear-white `--color-white: #eceff4` — exactly the `#ebeef4` card in the report\nscreenshot, on an otherwise-Nord `#353d4a` page (both values are the screenshot's\nslightly colour-managed renditions of Nord `#eceff4` / `#323a49`).\n\nThat defect is **already fixed in this branch and in `main`**. Commit `70f6236`\n(\"nord theme bug with todos\", Job `role_nord-theme-bug-with-todos`, 2026-08-25)\nswept the literal-white surfaces to semantic tokens; the auth cards became\n`bg-c-bg-surface` and `TimePicker.svelte` became `bg-c-bg-modal`. It reached this\nbranch via the `main` merge `8c0ad30`, so `git diff main...HEAD` is docs-only and\nno product source change was required.\n\nThis pass adds the missing objective evidence: production was measured directly\nand **already runs the fixed markup** — a browser probe of\n`https://my.solyto.app/auth/login` with `theme=nord` renders the card as\n`rgb(59,66,82)` (`#3b4252`), with no white pixels on the page. The earlier\n\"production is a stale deploy older than `70f6236`\" hypothesis is disproven.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: Captured the previously-missing environment facts against the real\n  production app (`my.solyto.app`) with Playwright (the engine `shot` uses,\n  used because `shot` cannot seed `localStorage`). Under `theme=nord`:\n  `localStorage.theme = \"nord\"`, `documentElement.className = \"\"`,\n  card class includes `bg-c-bg-surface`, computed card background\n  `rgb(59,66,82)`. A full theme sweep and three reference screenshots are in\n  `screenshots/` (`render-report.md`). Recorded in `notes.md`.\n  No product code changed.\n\nTASK-2: No change needed. All nine auth card blocks already carry the requested\n  `bg-c-bg-surface` (`login:110`, `register:92`, `forgot-password:72,100`,\n  `reset-password:72,85,105`, `logout:27`, `verify/...:44`), and\n  `--color-c-bg-surface` maps to `#ffffff` in default light,\n  `var(--color-s-dark-2)` in default dark (pixel-identical to the old\n  `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`), and `#3b4252` under Nord. The two secondary\n  substitutions in the task were deliberately **not** applied:\n  - `dark:text-white` → `text-c-neutral-9 dark:text-white`: the labels already\n    inherit a correctly themed colour from `src/routes/auth/+layout.svelte`\n    (`text-c-neutral-8` = Nord `#d8dee9`, ≈7:1 contrast on `#3b4252`). Adding an\n    explicit light-mode token would change default-light rendering\n    (`c-neutral-8` → `c-neutral-9`), which TASK-2 says must stay pixel-identical.\n  - `border-white/5` → token border: no target token was specified, and the\n    available `--color-c-border` is transparent / not overridden by Nord, so a\n    blind swap would remove the card outline. The accepted upstream fix\n    (`70f6236`) left this decorative border untouched.\n\nTASK-3: Resolved (no change). `src/lib/components/forms/TimePicker.svelte`\n  already uses `bg-c-bg-modal`, fixed by the same `70f6236` sweep. No\n  `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-*` pair remains anywhere under `src/`; the eight\n  remaining `bg-white` hits are decorative (IconPlate, Toggle knob, ScoreBar,\n  Progress).\n\nTASK-4: Rendered verification completed against production (which is\n  byte-for-byte the auth-card markup this branch contains, since the branch has\n  no product diff). Swept default light, default dark and all nine single-mode\n  themes; the login card is dark under every single-mode dark theme and no\n  unexpected light surface (>3000px²) appears. `npm run check` / `lint` / `test`\n  could not be run because `node_modules` is not installed and the project hard\n  rule forbids installing packages without asking; with no product diff there is\n  nothing new for them to check. Full table in\n  `screenshots/render-report.md`.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- The job is a duplicate: the defect was already fixed by `70f6236` before this\n  branch's `main` merge. Product behaviour needs no change; the resolution is to\n  close this job against the existing fix.\n- `docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/tasks.md` is stale: it was written before the\n  `70f6236` merge and describes the pre-fix auth-card classes. Left as the\n  analyst's artifact; the corrected picture is here and in `notes.md`.\n- Inherited open items (out of scope): pre-paint theme script / FOUC hardening\n  (there is still a brief flash of the light default on first paint for\n  single-mode themes, because `theme.load()` runs in `onMount`), an `html`\n  background-color rule, account-synced theme setting, and\n  `static/themes/y2k/y2k.css` existing on disk but missing from `themes.ts`.\n- Cosmetic consistency (not applied): auth labels use bare `dark:text-white`\n  while the rest of the app mostly uses `text-c-neutral-9 dark:text-white`.\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","time":{"start":1791394904818,"end":1791394904849}},"id":"prt_11774e577001kmIOvdGkAz24fz","sessionID":"ses_ee88fe25bffe2xhvlL8jpyAcF9","messageID":"msg_11774db31001PKf1kU9Hgshy8w"}}
