{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395001231,"sessionID":"ses_ee88a4facffepjDmvmILMMvwOb","part":{"id":"prt_117766a49001KxP84fbsZ3YvnA","messageID":"msg_117765cf8001R3zZcqK1gBCmON","sessionID":"ses_ee88a4facffepjDmvmILMMvwOb","type":"text","text":"The branch is now in its final state. The only remaining dirty file is the harness-managed `session.log`, which gets a new entry appended after every tool call (including commits) — it cannot be made clean while the session is live, and prior passes ended the same way.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe job is already resolved; no product change was warranted. I verified this independently rather than trusting the prior passes' notes:\n\n- **Root cause** (from `tasks.md`/`implementation.md`): auth cards used literal `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. `ThemeState.apply()` (`src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`) strips the `dark` class for single-mode themes (`supportsDarkMode: false`), so the `dark:bg-s-dark-2` fallback never fired under Nord and the card stayed at Nord's near-white `--color-white: #eceff4`.\n- **Current code**: all six auth cards already use semantic `bg-c-bg-surface`; `grep 'bg-white' src/ | grep 'dark:bg-s-dark'` returns nothing; the only remaining `dark:bg-s-dark` in `auth/` is the intentional `+layout.svelte` default-dark fallback.\n- **Provenance**: the fix shipped upstream in `70f6236`, which is an ancestor of `HEAD`; `git diff main...HEAD --stat` confirms the branch is docs-only. Production was measured directly and already serves the fixed markup (`rgb(59,66,82)` Nord card, no white pixels).\n- **Skipped substitutions**: `dark:text-white` → `text-c-neutral-9 dark:text-white` would alter default-light rendering (labels already inherit themed `text-c-neutral-8`), and `border-white/5` has no specified token equivalent — both skips are justified and documented.\n- **Verification limit**: `node_modules` is absent and package installation is forbidden, so `npm run check/lint/test/build` could not be run; with no product diff there is nothing new to check.\n\n## Changes\n\n- No product source changes (the defect was already fixed upstream).\n- Committed the remaining harness session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`) so no agent-left changes remain (`c00ff50`, `61a81cc`). `implementation.md`, `notes.md`, and `screenshots/` were already present and committed.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- This job is a duplicate of the earlier `70f6236` fix; the resolution is to close it against that commit.\n- `tasks.md` is stale (written pre-fix) — left untouched as the analyst's artifact.\n- Inherited out-of-scope items: pre-paint theme script / FOUC hardening, `html` background-color rule, account-synced theme setting, and `static/themes/y2k/y2k.css` missing from `themes.ts`.","time":{"start":1791394998857,"end":1791395001223}}}
