{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1791395199961,"sessionID":"ses_ee887a236ffe6kU98oJc5sam9e","part":{"id":"prt_117797bd5001e1SwdCcK369FNU","messageID":"msg_11779770f001N0ca5HW101GFka","sessionID":"ses_ee887a236ffe6kU98oJc5sam9e","snapshot":"","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395202743,"sessionID":"ses_ee887a236ffe6kU98oJc5sam9e","part":{"id":"prt_117797eeb001sKioUoPwNv3bxg","messageID":"msg_11779770f001N0ca5HW101GFka","sessionID":"ses_ee887a236ffe6kU98oJc5sam9e","type":"text","text":"Done. Here's what I found and did.\n\n## Outcome\n\nThe `brief.md` bug **is already fixed on this branch** — no product code change is needed, and none was made.\n\n**Root cause (verified in-repo):** the auth cards used literal `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. The `dark:` variant only fires when `<html>` has the `dark` class, and `ThemeState.apply()` explicitly removes it for every single-mode theme (`supportsDarkMode: false`: nord, skyrim, catppuccin-*, gruvbox, dracula, terminal, paper, atari). So under Nord the fallback never applied and the card stayed at Nord's deliberately near-white `--color-white: #eceff4` — the white card on an otherwise-Nord page.\n\n**Why nothing to change:** commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\", the later job `role_nord-theme-bug-with-todos`) swept the auth cards to `bg-c-bg-surface` and `TimePicker` to `bg-c-bg-modal`. That commit is an ancestor of `HEAD` via the `main` merge `8c0ad30`.\n\n**Independent re-verification I ran:**\n- `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 HEAD` → true\n- `git diff main...HEAD --stat -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` → empty (branch is docs-only)\n- All six auth cards use `bg-c-bg-surface`; `grep -rn 'bg-white' src/ | grep 'dark:bg-s-dark'` → no matches\n- Prior session's production probe of `my.solyto.app/auth/login` at `theme=nord` shows card `rgb(59,66,82)` = Nord `#3b4252`, no white pixels. Production already serves the fixed markup.\n\nI appended a final re-verification section to `implementation.md` and committed it, then committed the harness session artifacts. Worktree is clean.\n\n## Notes / follow-ups\n- `tasks.md` is stale (written pre-fix, describes the old classes).\n- `npm run check/lint/test` couldn't run: `node_modules` isn't installed, and the project forbids installing packages without approval.\n- Same bug class, out of this job's auth scope: `src/lib/components/todos/props/Progress.svelte` still uses `not-dark:bg-white` (renders white under single-mode dark themes) — documented as a candidate follow-up in `implementation.md`, not changed here.","time":{"start":1791395200747,"end":1791395202731}}}
