{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395327071,"sessionID":"ses_ee885d62fffegfYx4euML0F65K","part":{"id":"prt_1177b625b00125MJ3syhLQwUyB","messageID":"msg_1177b5912001O3VsoNQrjIW2Y0","sessionID":"ses_ee885d62fffegfYx4euML0F65K","type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI worked the job at `docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login` on branch `feature/create_theme-on-login` (matches `brief.md`).\n\n**Outcome: the bug is already fixed; no product code change is required.** I independently verified this rather than relying on the prior passes:\n\n- Commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\", 2026-08-25) changed the exact offending classes on all six auth cards from `bg-white ... dark:bg-s-dark-2` to `bg-c-bg-surface`. `git show 70f6236 -- src/routes/auth/` confirms it touches `login`, `register`, `forgot-password`, `reset-password`, `logout`, `verify/[user_id]/[token]`.\n- `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 HEAD` → true, so the fix reaches this branch via the `main` merge `8c0ad30`.\n- `git diff main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` → empty: this branch contributes **no** product change relative to `main`; only the job's own docs.\n- `grep 'bg-white' src/ | grep 'dark:bg-s-dark'` → no matches; all six auth cards carry `bg-c-bg-surface`, and `TimePicker.svelte` (TASK-3) already uses `bg-c-bg-modal`.\n\nRoot cause (already documented in the job's `implementation.md`/`notes.md`): literal `bg-white` stayed near-white under Nord because Nord deliberately sets `--color-white: #eceff4`, and the `dark:bg-s-dark-2` fallback never fires for single-mode themes (`ThemeState.apply()` removes the `dark` class). The semantic token `bg-c-bg-surface` maps to the correct themed colour (`#3b4252` under Nord).\n\n## Changes\n\nNo source files changed — none were needed.\n\n- Committed the only outstanding worktree state (harness-generated `session.log` / `tokens.json`) so the worktree is left clean: `fc66e8d` and `57179c5`.\n\nTASK-1–TASK-4 were already delivered by prior passes (`implementation.md`, `notes.md`, `screenshots/`); I re-verified their claims and found them accurate.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- `node_modules` is not installed, so per the repo hard rule (no installing packages without asking) `npm run check`/`lint`/`test`/`build` could not be run. With zero product diff there is nothing new for them to validate.\n- `tasks.md` is stale (written before the `70f6236` fix); it describes pre-fix auth-card classes. Left as the analyst's artifact.\n- Open items already tracked outside this job: pre-paint theme script / FOUC hardening, `html` background-color rule, account-synced theme, `y2k.css` missing from `themes.ts`, and `Progress.svelte`'s `not-dark:bg-white` (same bug class, out of auth scope).","time":{"start":1791395324507,"end":1791395327065}}}
