{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395415655,"sessionID":"ses_ee88484faffeNo5WAkjfucNltw","part":{"id":"prt_1177cbd23001mUfOzriFLpN7TU","messageID":"msg_1177cb5b6001GMDkiQRtmFP6G4","sessionID":"ses_ee88484faffeNo5WAkjfucNltw","type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nThe job `create_theme-on-login` was already fully resolved before this session; I verified that independently rather than duplicating work, recorded one additional check, and left the worktree clean.\n\n### What I found\n\n**Root cause (from the brief's white login background):** the auth page *cards* used literal `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. For every single-mode theme (`supportsDarkMode: false` — nord, skyrim, catppuccin-*, gruvbox, dracula, terminal, paper, atari), `ThemeState.apply()` removes the `dark` class, so the `dark:` fallback never fired and the card stayed at Nord's intentionally near-white `--color-white: #eceff4`.\n\n**It is already fixed — no code change required:**\n- Commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\") swept those cards to the semantic `bg-c-bg-surface`; it is an ancestor of `HEAD` via the `main` merge.\n- `git diff main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` is empty — this branch contributes no product source change.\n- All six auth cards carry `bg-c-bg-surface`; `TimePicker.svelte` (TASK-3) carries `bg-c-bg-modal`.\n- `--color-c-bg-surface` maps to `#ffffff` light / `var(--color-s-dark-2)` dark (pixel-identical to the old classes) and `#3b4252` under Nord.\n- The prior pass already captured production facts showing `my.solyto.app/auth/login` under `theme=nord` renders the card `rgb(59,66,82)` with no white pixels (screenshots + `render-report.md`).\n\n### What I changed\n\n- Appended a short text-legibility verification to `implementation.md`: since `dark:text-white` never fires under single-mode themes, labels inherit `text-c-neutral-8`; I confirmed every dark theme overrides that palette (Nord/dracula/gruvbox/skyrim/catppuccin-mocha explicitly, atari/terminal via `--color-gray-*`) and light themes fall back to base dark gray — no low-contrast case.\n- Committed the session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`).\n\n### Notes\n- `tasks.md` is stale (written pre-`70f6236`); the corrected picture is in `implementation.md` and `notes.md`.\n- `node_modules` is absent and the project forbids installing packages without approval, so `check`/`lint`/`test` could not be run — with no product diff there is nothing new to check.\n- Out-of-scope follow-ups remain documented: pre-paint theme script (FOUC), `html` background rule, account-synced theme, `y2k.css` missing from `themes.ts`, and `Progress.svelte`'s `not-dark:bg-white`.\n\nWorking tree is clean. No human decision was needed.","time":{"start":1791395413283,"end":1791395415647}}}
