{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1791396098683,"sessionID":"ses_ee87a605cffeI9DRiwhYV7qP1z","part":{"id":"prt_1178732770017K84qbLevYYaPL","messageID":"msg_117872cdb001sTfRErWyfxkzqN","sessionID":"ses_ee87a605cffeI9DRiwhYV7qP1z","snapshot":"","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1791396101436,"sessionID":"ses_ee87a605cffeI9DRiwhYV7qP1z","part":{"id":"prt_117873461001H2xYks23yJSjmL","messageID":"msg_117872cdb001sTfRErWyfxkzqN","sessionID":"ses_ee87a605cffeI9DRiwhYV7qP1z","type":"text","text":"Done. The worktree is clean and the branch is correct (`feature/create_theme-on-login`, matching `brief.md`).\n\n## What I found and did\n\nThe white surface in the report is the auth **card**, and the fix already exists in this branch — this job is a **duplicate**, so no product code change was needed.\n\n**Root cause:** the six auth cards used `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. The `dark:` variant only fires when `<html>` has the `dark` class, but `ThemeState.apply()` (`src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`) removes that class for every single-mode theme. Under Nord the card therefore stayed at Nord's deliberately near-white `--color-white: #eceff4`.\n\n**Already fixed upstream:** commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\") swept the auth cards to `bg-c-bg-surface` and `TimePicker.svelte` to `bg-c-bg-modal`. `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 HEAD` → true, and `git diff main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/` is empty.\n\n**Verification I ran this pass (independent):**\n- Playwright probe of production `https://my.solyto.app/auth/login` with `theme=nord`: card computed background `rgb(59,66,82)` (= Nord `#3b4252`), `html.className` empty, card class `… bg-c-bg-surface …`, Nord stylesheet loaded. No white card.\n- Decoded the `brief.md` screenshot myself: 973×989, ~90% Nord page `#303848` with a ~5.9% near-white `#e8e8f0` region — confirming the white surface is the card, matching the pre-fix markup.\n- `grep` confirms no `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark*` pair remains under `src/`; all nine auth-card blocks carry the semantic token.\n\n**Task disposition:** TASK-1 captured (production facts), TASK-2 already satisfied, TASK-3 already satisfied, TASK-4 code/render verification done. `npm run check/lint/test/build` still cannot run because `node_modules` is absent and project rules forbid installing packages without asking; with no product diff there is nothing new to check.\n\n**Commits:** `d82f566` (consolidated `implementation.md`) and `7619cdd` (session artifacts). Follow-ups recorded in `implementation.md`: FOUC pre-paint hardening, `html` background rule, `themes.ts` missing `y2k`, and `Progress.svelte:74`'s `not-dark:bg-white` (same bug class, outside auth scope).","time":{"start":1791396099169,"end":1791396101429}}}
