{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402188455,"sessionID":"ses_ee81c8321ffee0yUMADgf5p7WF","part":{"id":"prt_117e41a7a0013fcg0CL2OC3C19","messageID":"msg_117e40e60001KhI1xcxDOHdJDV","sessionID":"ses_ee81c8321ffee0yUMADgf5p7WF","type":"text","text":"Everything checks out. The core finding is verified:\n\n- The auth-page cards already use the semantic `bg-c-bg-surface` token; no `bg-white` + `dark:bg-s-dark*` pair remains anywhere in `src/`.\n- `70f6236` (the fix from the `role_nord-theme-bug-with-todos` job) is an ancestor of this branch, and `git diff main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` is empty — this branch carries no product source change.\n- The remaining `dark:text-white` on auth pages is intentional and correct: under single-mode themes `.dark` is absent so labels inherit the themed color, and under default-dark `.dark` is present so `text-white` is right.\n- Production render evidence in `screenshots/render-report.md` shows the login card is Nord `#3b4252` with no white pixels.\n\nThe bug described in the brief was already fixed on `main` before this branch merged; there is genuinely no product change to make. I will not invent one. I'll just sync the live session log so the worktree is clean.","time":{"start":1791402187390,"end":1791402188446}}}
