{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791402250719,"sessionID":"ses_ee81bb8f2ffe5kGw8HEzVtimhV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_00_ZRRvBbyeJFljHuGymdUQ7179","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","oldString":"## Known issues / follow-ups","newString":"## Second verification pass (fresh developer session, 2026-10-07)\n\nRe-ran the decisive checks independently rather than trusting the earlier notes:\n\n- `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 origin/main` → true, and\n  `git diff origin/main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` is empty, so the\n  auth-card fix is upstream on `origin/main` and this branch contributes no product\n  source change. `git show 70f6236 -- src/routes/auth/login/+page.svelte` confirms it\n  is the commit that changed the login card from\n  `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-2` to `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n- `grep -rn 'bg-white.*dark:bg-s-dark' src/` → no matches. All nine auth-card blocks\n  (`login:110`, `register:92`, `forgot-password:72,100`,\n  `reset-password:72,85,105`, `logout:27`, `verify/…:44`) carry `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n- Token mapping re-confirmed: `--color-c-bg-surface` is `#ffffff` in\n  `src/styles/tokens.css:24`, becomes `var(--color-s-dark-2)` under `html.dark`\n  (`src/styles/default.css:19`), and is `#3b4252` under Nord\n  (`static/themes/nord/nord.css:34,73`). So default light/dark stay pixel-identical\n  to the old `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`, while single-mode themes get a themed card.\n\nConclusion unchanged: no product change is warranted; this job duplicates `70f6236`.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md\n+++ /workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md\n@@ -79,8 +79,29 @@\n   `lint`, `test`, and `build` could not be run because `node_modules` is not\n   installed and the project hard rule forbids installing packages without asking;\n   with no product diff there is nothing new for them to check.\n \n+## Second verification pass (fresh developer session, 2026-10-07)\n+\n+Re-ran the decisive checks independently rather than trusting the earlier notes:\n+\n+- `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 origin/main` → true, and\n+  `git diff origin/main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` is empty, so the\n+  auth-card fix is upstream on `origin/main` and this branch contributes no product\n+  source change. `git show 70f6236 -- src/routes/auth/login/+page.svelte` confirms it\n+  is the commit that changed the login card from\n+  `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-2` to `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n+- `grep -rn 'bg-white.*dark:bg-s-dark' src/` → no matches. All nine auth-card blocks\n+  (`login:110`, `register:92`, `forgot-password:72,100`,\n+  `reset-password:72,85,105`, `logout:27`, `verify/…:44`) carry `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n+- Token mapping re-confirmed: `--color-c-bg-surface` is `#ffffff` in\n+  `src/styles/tokens.css:24`, becomes `var(--color-s-dark-2)` under `html.dark`\n+  (`src/styles/default.css:19`), and is `#3b4252` under Nord\n+  (`static/themes/nord/nord.css:34,73`). So default light/dark stay pixel-identical\n+  to the old `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`, while single-mode themes get a themed card.\n+\n+Conclusion unchanged: no product change is warranted; this job duplicates `70f6236`.\n+\n ## Known issues / follow-ups\n \n - This job is a duplicate: the defect was already fixed by `70f6236` before this\n   branch's `main` merge. Product behaviour needs no change; close against the\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md","patch":"Index: /workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/