{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402372125,"sessionID":"ses_ee819c442ffeKjH5OO9xpbRknd","part":{"id":"prt_117e6e414001tyOsDKEoZ3vHVw","messageID":"msg_117e6dcc1001cdEu1Bbzz7MJ17","sessionID":"ses_ee819c442ffeKjH5OO9xpbRknd","type":"text","text":"Done. Here's what I found and did.\n\n## Summary\n\nI read `brief.md` and `tasks.md`, confirmed the branch is `feature/create_theme-on-login` (matches the brief), and independently verified the current state rather than trusting the prior sessions' notes.\n\n**The defect described in the brief is already fixed in this branch and is a no-op job.**\n\n- The white login surface was the auth **card** using the literal pair `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. The `dark:` fallback only fires when `<html>` has the `dark` class, and `ThemeState.apply()` strips that class for every single-mode theme (`src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`); Nord deliberately keeps `--color-white: #eceff4`, so the card stayed near-white.\n- That exact pattern was swept to the semantic `bg-c-bg-surface` (and `TimePicker` to `bg-c-bg-modal`) by commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\", 2026-08-25), which is an ancestor of `HEAD`.\n- `git diff main...HEAD -- src static tests package.json` is **empty** — the branch contributes no product source change.\n- All nine auth-card blocks now use `bg-c-bg-surface`; `grep 'bg-white.*dark:bg-s-dark' src/` returns nothing.\n- Token mapping confirmed: `#ffffff` default-light, `var(--color-s-dark-2)` under `html.dark`, `#3b4252` under Nord.\n\n**Changes**\n\n- Appended a concise \"Fourth verification pass\" section to `implementation.md` documenting this session's independent checks, and committed it along with the harness artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`). Worktree is clean.\n\n**Known issues / follow-ups**\n\n- This job is a duplicate of `70f6236`; the correct outcome is to close it against that existing fix.\n- `tasks.md` is stale (rev 4, written before the fix merged) and still describes the pre-fix classes.\n- Out of scope: `src/lib/components/todos/props/Progress.svelte:74` still uses `not-dark:bg-white` (same bug class, non-auth); plus the inherited items in `implementation.md` (pre-paint theme script/FOUC hardening, account-synced theme, `y2k.css` missing from `themes.ts`).\n\nI did not run `npm run check/lint/test/build` because `node_modules` is not installed and the project hard rule forbids installing packages; there is no product diff for them to validate. Rendered evidence from production remains in `screenshots/render-report.md`.","time":{"start":1791402370068,"end":1791402372115}}}
