{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402844654,"sessionID":"ses_ee81286edffezHhw071dDwl2uH","part":{"id":"prt_117ee19950010eW93JQonuTTWA","messageID":"msg_117ee1094001kA5m0BbypAYUX7","sessionID":"ses_ee81286edffezHhw071dDwl2uH","type":"text","text":"Done. The worktree is clean and the task is committed.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis job (`create_theme-on-login`) asks why a mostly-Nord login page showed a white surface on production. I independently verified the repository rather than trusting the prior sessions' notes:\n\n- Branch `feature/create_theme-on-login` matches `brief.md`.\n- `git diff origin/main...HEAD -- src static tests package.json` is **empty** — this branch adds only the job's docs.\n- Commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\") is an ancestor of both `HEAD` and `origin/main`. It already swept all six auth cards from `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-2` to the semantic `bg-c-bg-surface` token, and `TimePicker.svelte` to `bg-c-bg-modal`.\n- No `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark*` pair remains in `src/`; all nine auth-card blocks carry `bg-c-bg-surface`. Remaining `bg-white` uses are decorative (icon dots, toggle knob, score bar) plus the known `Progress.svelte:74` follow-up.\n- Production `https://my.solyto.app/auth/login` already serves the fixed markup; the white card from `brief.md` is not reproducible under Nord.\n\n**No product change is warranted** — the defect was fixed upstream before this branch's `main` merge. The job is a duplicate of `70f6236` and should be closed against it.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **TASK-1 / TASK-2 / TASK-3 / TASK-4:** No product code changed (all already fixed upstream; the task file is stale at rev 4).\n- Updated `docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/implementation.md` with a final disposition recording the empty product diff, ancestor checks, and the recommendation to close the job as a duplicate.\n- Committed the harness session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`) so the worktree is clean.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- The job keeps being re-dispatched despite no code change being required; it should be closed as a duplicate of `70f6236`.\n- `npm run check`/`lint`/`test`/`build` could not be run — `node_modules` is absent and the project hard rule forbids installing packages without asking. With no product diff there is nothing new for them to check.\n- Out of scope (inherited): FOUC/pre-paint theme script hardening, `html`/`body` background rule, account-synced theme, `Progress.svelte:74` `not-dark:bg-white` follow-up.","time":{"start":1791402842517,"end":1791402844648}}}
