{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403492245,"sessionID":"ses_ee809ab48ffeq1SFPOngrWaLuR","part":{"id":"prt_117f7fac50011sg87wFUY2EETL","messageID":"msg_117f7f2cc001jV8XWb4zIq0pYM","sessionID":"ses_ee809ab48ffeq1SFPOngrWaLuR","type":"text","text":"Worktree is clean. Here is the outcome.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis job is a **duplicate of an already-shipped fix** — no product change is required or appropriate. I independently re-verified this rather than trusting the prior sessions' artifacts:\n\n**Root cause (from code):** auth cards used the literal pair `bg-white dark:bg-s-dark-2`. The `dark:` variant only fires when `<html>.dark` is set, but `ThemeState.apply()` removes it for every single-mode theme (`supportsDarkMode: false`, including Nord) at `src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`. So under Nord the card stayed at Nord's deliberately near-white `--color-white: #eceff4`, producing the white card in the brief.\n\n**Already fixed upstream:** commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\") swept the auth cards to `bg-c-bg-surface` and `TimePicker` to `bg-c-bg-modal`. It is an ancestor of both `HEAD` and `origin/main`.\n\n**Independent verification I ran this session:**\n- `git diff main...HEAD -- src/ static/ tests/ package.json` → **empty** (branch adds no code).\n- `curl https://my.solyto.app/auth/login` → HTTP 200, **0** × `bg-white`, **1** × `bg-c-bg-surface`.\n- Fresh headless Chromium (global Playwright) with `localStorage.theme='nord'`: card class = `… bg-c-bg-surface …`, computed `background-color: rgb(59, 66, 82)` (#3b4252), `html.class=\"\"`. Dark, not white.\n- All nine auth-card blocks carry `bg-c-bg-surface`; `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark*` no longer exists anywhere under `src/`.\n\n**Task status:** TASK-1 (env facts) recorded in `notes.md`; TASK-2 already satisfied (no change); TASK-3 already satisfied (`TimePicker` uses `bg-c-bg-modal`); TASK-4 verified at code/commit/markup level. `npm run check/lint/test/build` could not run because `node_modules` is absent and the project rule forbids installing packages unattended.\n\n**Commit:** `b2f9dde [create] chore: sync session artifacts (independent re-verification, duplicate of 70f6236)` — only the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json` changed; `implementation.md` already contains the accurate final summary and was left intact.\n\nKnown follow-ups (out of scope, recorded in `implementation.md`): `Progress.svelte:74` still uses `not-dark:bg-white`; pre-paint theme script/FOUC hardening; `html` background rule; `static/themes/y2k/y2k.css` missing from `themes.ts`.","time":{"start":1791403489989,"end":1791403492237}}}
