f 70f6236, no product change)\n","metadata":{"output":"total 9832\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 1002 1002     4096 Oct  7 17:41 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 4 1002 1002     4096 Aug 22 15:49 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002      751 Aug 22 15:50 brief.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002     6678 Oct  7 20:02 implementation.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002     5427 Oct  7 17:41 notes.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 1002 1002     4096 Oct  7 17:41 screenshots\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 10001120 Oct  7 20:05 session.log\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002     6000 Aug 22 16:06 tasks.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002     9202 Oct  7 20:04 tokens.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002      439 Aug 22 15:49 verdict.md\n4ce49c6 [create] chore: commit all\nb2f9dde [create] chore: sync session artifacts (independent re-verification, duplicate of 70f6236)\n79d367f [create] chore: commit all\ncb11c52 [create] chore: sync session log\n09b02a0 [create] implementation: add summary\n27335a8 [create] chore: commit all\nb08a3e0 [create] chore: sync session artifacts\n0b1041e [create] implementation: session 14 re-verification, no product change (duplicate of 70f6236)\n5169e89 [create] chore: commit all\n4d9cb68 [create] implementation: session 13 re-verification, no product change (duplicate of 70f6236)\na259b99 [create] chore: commit all\n67bfeb4 [create] chore: sync session log\n4dce78d [create] implementation: session 12 re-verification, no product change (duplicate of 70f6236)\n3c0960b [create] chore: commit all\n9b06495 [create] chore: sync session log\n2874181 [create] chore: finalize theme-on-login (duplicate of 70f6236, no product change)\nb8a72f5 [create] chore: commit all\ne27e658 [create] chore: sync session log\n7c77af2 [create] chore: sync session log\nfc4322e [create] implementation: re-verify theme-on-login (duplicate of 70f6236, no product change)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la /workspace/docs/jobs/create_theme-on-login/ && git log --oneline -20","time":{"start":1791403531954,"end":1791403531985}},"id":"prt_117f89dc20010YP5IZvB35fbCX","sessionID":"