{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403939160,"sessionID":"ses_ee80287fdffeBZlXIz12YKGjBW","part":{"id":"prt_117fecbd3001A5n5z4qazM7KGu","messageID":"msg_117fec407001VNkofjuR3iOvbo","sessionID":"ses_ee80287fdffeBZlXIz12YKGjBW","type":"text","text":"Done. Here's the outcome.\n\n## Result: no product change needed — verified duplicate of an upstream fix\n\nI independently re-verified the job rather than trusting the prior sessions' conclusion, and it holds up:\n\n**Root cause (confirmed from code)**\nThe white surface in the brief is the auth **card**, not the page or a failed theme load. The cards used `bg-white … dark:bg-s-dark-2`. For single-mode themes (`supportsDarkMode: false` — nord, skyrim, catppuccin-*, gruvbox, dracula, terminal, paper, atari) `ThemeState.apply()` runs `document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark')` (`src/lib/state/Theme.svelte.ts:81`), so the `dark:` fallback never fires and the card stays at Nord's near-white `--color-white: #eceff4`.\n\n**The fix already exists on `main`**\n- `git merge-base --is-ancestor 70f6236 HEAD` and `… origin/main` → **true**. Commit `70f6236` (\"nord theme bug with todos\", 2026-08-25) swept the auth cards to `bg-c-bg-surface` and `TimePicker` to `bg-c-bg-modal`. It reached this branch via merge `8c0ad30`.\n- `git diff main...HEAD -- src static tests package.json` → **empty**; this branch adds only job docs.\n- All nine auth-card blocks use `bg-c-bg-surface`; no `bg-white` remains in `src/routes/auth/`.\n\n**Live independent verification (production `https://my.solyto.app/auth/login`, Playwright + seeded localStorage):**\n| theme | card background | html class |\n|---|---|---|\n| nord | `rgb(59,66,82)` = Nord `#3b4252` | `\"\"` |\n| default | `rgb(255,255,255)` (by design) | `\"\"` |\n| atari | `rgb(13,0,32)` = `#0d0020` | `\"\"` |\n\n**Brief screenshot pixel analysis** (I can't see images, so measured it): 973×989, 90.2% dark Nord, 6.03% near-white — one card region on a Nord page, i.e. the pre-fix card, not a full-page FOUC.\n\n**Git state:** the worktree was left dirty by earlier agents' session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`); committed as `f538f35`, tree is now clean. `implementation.md` from the prior passes already documents all of this accurately, so I did not churn it.\n\n**Recommendation:** close this job against `70f6236`. The only remaining related item worth tracking is the same bug class outside auth scope: `src/lib/components/todos/props/Progress.svelte:74` still uses `not-dark:bg-white`, plus the pre-paint theme/FOUC hardening listed as a follow-up.","time":{"start":1791403936723,"end":1791403939156}}}
